      "text": "此人不能告诉你什么。",
      "source_text": "此人不能告诉你什么。",
      "source_line_start": 2,
      "source_line_end": 2,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 3,
      "number": 100,
      "number_raw": "100",
      "source_number": "100",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "你看见艾丽娅，一个沙漠强盗。",
      "source_text": "你看见艾丽娅，一个沙漠强盗。",
      "source_line_start": 3,
      "source_line_end": 3,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 4,
      "number": 101,
      "number_raw": "101",
      "source_number": "101",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "我是可汗的艾丽娅。我有什么能帮你？",
      "source_text": "我是可汗的艾丽娅。我有什么能帮你？",
      "source_line_start": 4,
      "source_line_end": 4,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 5,
      "number": 102,
      "number_raw": "102",
      "source_number": "102",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "我在找一个叫坦蒂的女孩。你见过她吗？",
      "source_text": "我在找一个叫坦蒂的女孩。你见过她吗？",
      "source_line_start": 5,
      "source_line_end": 5,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 6,
      "number": 103,
      "number_raw": "103",
      "source_number": "103",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "吻你一下如何？",
      "source_text": "吻你一下如何？",
      "source_line_start": 6,
      "source_line_end": 6,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 7,
      "number": 104,
      "number_raw": "104",
      "source_number": "104",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "为什么你们这些强盗攻击沙荫镇？",
      "source_text": "为什么你们这些强盗攻击沙荫镇？",
      "source_line_start": 7,
      "source_line_end": 7,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 8,
      "number": 105,
      "number_raw": "105",
      "source_number": "105",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "不，谢了。",
      "source_text": "不，谢了。",
      "source_line_start": 8,
      "source_line_end": 8,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 9,
      "number": 106,
      "number_raw": "106",
      "source_number": "106",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "呼哟！",
      "source_text": "呼哟！",
      "source_line_start": 9,
      "source_line_end": 9,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 10,
      "number": 107,
      "number_raw": "107",
      "source_number": "107",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "如果她是其中一个从沙荫镇捉来的女人，可能你应该在那里看看。现在走开，我还要把我这些刀磨锋利。",
      "source_text": "如果她是其中一个从沙荫镇捉来的女人，可能你应该在那里看看。现在走开，我还要把我这些刀磨锋利。",
      "source_line_start": 10,
      "source_line_end": 10,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 11,
      "number": 108,
      "number_raw": "108",
      "source_number": "108",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "亲亲这个！",
      "source_text": "亲亲这个！",
      "source_line_start": 11,
      "source_line_end": 11,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 12,
      "number": 109,
      "number_raw": "109",
      "source_number": "109",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "我们没攻击沙荫镇的人。我们和他们来自同一个地方。也只有这样才能让他们和我们分享粮食！",
      "source_text": "我们没攻击沙荫镇的人。我们和他们来自同一个地方。也只有这样才能让他们和我们分享粮食！",
      "source_line_start": 12,
      "source_line_end": 12,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 13,
      "number": 110,
      "number_raw": "110",
      "source_number": "110",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "但是你们伤害他们的家畜还威胁他们。",
      "source_text": "但是你们伤害他们的家畜还威胁他们。",
      "source_line_start": 13,
      "source_line_end": 13,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 14,
      "number": 111,
      "number_raw": "111",
      "source_number": "111",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "我感觉很公平。",
      "source_text": "我感觉很公平。",
      "source_line_start": 14,
      "source_line_end": 14,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 15,
      "number": 112,
      "number_raw": "112",
      "source_number": "112",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "嗯，是啊。我想我该走了。",
      "source_text": "嗯，是啊。我想我该走了。",
      "source_line_start": 15,
      "source_line_end": 15,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 16,
      "number": 113,
      "number_raw": "113",
      "source_number": "113",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "听起来你和他们一样窝囊。听着，如果他们有了饥荒的麻烦，那么是他们自己没预先计划的错。想想我们是用自己的能耐和他们做买卖。",
      "source_text": "听起来你和他们一样窝囊。听着，如果他们有了饥荒的麻烦，那么是他们自己没预先计划的错。想想我们是用自己的能耐和他们做买卖。",
      "source_line_start": 16,
      "source_line_end": 16,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 17,
      "number": 114,
      "number_raw": "114",
      "source_number": "114",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "用能耐做买卖？！？这怎么会是用能耐来买卖？你们没有给他们任何东西。",
      "source_text": "用能耐做买卖？！？这怎么会是用能耐来买卖？你们没有给他们任何东西。",
      "source_line_start": 17,
      "source_line_end": 17,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 18,
      "number": 115,
      "number_raw": "115",
      "source_number": "115",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "嗯，没错，如果鸡也会有三条腿的话。",
      "source_text": "嗯，没错，如果鸡也会有三条腿的话。",
      "source_line_start": 18,
      "source_line_end": 18,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 19,
      "number": 116,
      "number_raw": "116",
      "source_number": "116",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "嗯，好吧。我想现在我该走了。",
      "source_text": "嗯，好吧。我想现在我该走了。",
      "source_line_start": 19,
      "source_line_end": 19,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 20,
      "number": 117,
      "number_raw": "117",
      "source_number": "117",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "我很抱歉，但是我听不懂你在说什么。我正在磨锋利这些刀，而且我不喜欢被打搅。",
      "source_text": "我很抱歉，但是我听不懂你在说什么。我正在磨锋利这些刀，而且我不喜欢被打搅。",
      "source_line_start": 20,
      "source_line_end": 20,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 21,
      "number": 118,
      "number_raw": "118",
      "source_number": "118",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "我给他们的可能是最重要的东西。我们给他们枯燥的生活添加刺激。",
      "source_text": "我给他们的可能是最重要的东西。我们给他们枯燥的生活添加刺激。",
      "source_line_start": 21,
      "source_line_end": 21,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 22,
      "number": 119,
      "number_raw": "119",
      "source_number": "119",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "我不认为他们想要你们这种刺激。",
      "source_text": "我不认为他们想要你们这种刺激。",
      "source_line_start": 22,
      "source_line_end": 22,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 23,
      "number": 120,
